{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"筋脉治法 - 标签","description":"Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"筋脉治法：论筋病 论脉病","date_published":"2026-06-02T11:36:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-06-02T11:39:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/4-11-jingmaizhifa/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/4-11-jingmaizhifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["筋脉治法","筋病","脉病"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“筋脉治法”部分，专论筋缩身痛与脉涩体衰的辨治法则。核心思想是：筋之舒在于血和，脉之平在于气足。治筋必须治血兼疏肝郁，治脉必须补气兼引药达表。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“筋脉治法”部分，专论\u003cstrong\u003e筋缩身痛与脉涩体衰\u003c/strong\u003e的辨治法则。核心思想是：\u003cstrong\u003e筋之舒在于血和，脉之平在于气足。治筋必须治血兼疏肝郁，治脉必须补气兼引药达表\u003c/strong\u003e。"}]}